# M25 VoxBoolean: Box + Sphere -> Union and Difference A - B; the preview hides input B, Accept creates a new entity, one Undo removes it
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.6,-0.55,0.6
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 50,40,30
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Тогда 0_inputs Box at the origin and a Sphere overlapping its top corner, both selected
Дано run Modeling "VoxBoolean inputs: Hide Inputs"
Дано --subject modeling set VoxBoolean.VoxelCount 24
Когда run Modeling "VoxOps tool: VoxBoolean"
Когда run Modeling "VoxBoolean operation: Union"
Тогда 1a_union_computing the Sphere input is already hidden while the operator runs (status "computing")
Тогда-вид 1_union_preview VoxBoolean bar (Accept/Cancel); the Sphere input is hidden, the Box shows the Union preview (box with the sphere bulging out of its top corner)
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда 1b_union_accepted a new entity "Box VoxBoolean" holds the Union; both inputs hidden; it is selected
Тогда-вид 1_union the Union result alone: box with the sphere bulging out of its top corner
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда 1_union_undo the Union entity is gone; Box and Sphere visible again
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Когда run Modeling "VoxOps tool: VoxBoolean"
Когда run Modeling "VoxBoolean operation: Difference A - B"
Тогда 2a_difference_computing the Sphere is hidden while the operator runs
Тогда-вид 2_difference the Sphere is hidden; the Box shows a spherical bite out of its top corner
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Cancel"
Тогда 2_difference_cancel the tool ended; Box unchanged and the Sphere visible again
